  {
   "id": "super-adventure-hand-216520@major-2023-06-06",
   "gameId": "super-adventure-hand-216520",
   "displayName": "Development update - Guerrilla Collective",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-06-06T11:07:25.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Continuing on my plan to do more regular updates here is this weeks and it’s an exciting one.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I’ve been busy working on my levels, tweaking old ones and optimizing Super Adventure Hand further.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The exciting part is that late on Wednesday / Thursday (depending on where you are) I will be releasing a new updated demo. This will have lots of new tweaks, fixes, squashed bugs and a brand new level to play!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "There is also one other addition but I won’t spoil the surprise, you’ll just have to check it out and let me know what you think!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Super Adventure Hand will also make an appearance at the Guerrilla Collective so tune into the stream to check it out on Wednesday!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
