  {
   "id": "super-adventure-hand-216520@major-2023-05-29",
   "gameId": "super-adventure-hand-216520",
   "displayName": "Development update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-05-29T18:56:12.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "I’m going to try and do more regular updates on things I’ve been working on so here goes!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This last week I spent a large chunk of time creating some new levels. I managed to make 5 more which have all come together nicely. They offer various different challenges and I promise I’ve not been too devious!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To tease you a little I can reveal that in these levels there is more fire, pipes, keys (of course) some little ones and plenty of opportunities to use your brains (well hand brains). I’ve also found an opportunity to reuse some other aspects of some previous levels in new and interesting ways.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "There is some exciting stuff coming which I can’t say much about yet but be prepared to see some new things in early June!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
